WEBVTT

1
00:00:02,700 --> 00:00:04,100
We are friends of Linghao

2
00:00:04,660 --> 00:00:06,740
He and his cousin are in that room

3
00:00:07,140 --> 00:00:13,530
I didn’t expect that I’m a grown man

4
00:00:14,010 --> 00:00:15,630
I need a child to comfort me

5
00:00:15,630 --> 00:00:16,790
Cousin, what are you talking about?

6
00:00:16,790 --> 00:00:18,510
I was scared to death when I was crazy

7
00:00:18,710 --> 00:00:20,150
If it weren't for my schoolgirl and his tricks,

8
00:00:20,550 --> 00:00:22,110
I would have died in school a long time ago

9
00:00:22,350 --> 00:00:24,810
Cousin, where is Sister Shuyao and Pingping?

10
00:00:25,570 --> 00:00:29,660
Sister Shuyao Pingping

11
00:00:30,180 --> 00:00:32,580
Didn't I tell you to hide? Why did you come out?

12
00:00:32,580 --> 00:00:35,260
I'm worried about you, you're dead

13
00:00:35,820 --> 00:00:38,460
won't die

14
00:00:38,660 --> 00:00:39,620
None of us will die

15
00:00:39,820 --> 00:00:40,740
Qing Shui is very powerful

16
00:00:40,820 --> 00:00:42,980
We relied on his cousin, Sister Shu Yao, all the way

17
00:00:43,460 --> 00:00:44,580
It's far from the city

18
00:00:44,740 --> 00:00:45,740
Crazy people can't get in for now

19
00:00:45,940 --> 00:00:47,700
We can wait for notification or rescue from the government

20
00:00:47,820 --> 00:00:49,780
We can think of a way together. It's great. It's really not possible.

21
00:00:49,780 --> 00:00:51,460
You can also go north to a colder place

22
00:00:51,660 --> 00:00:52,980
I don’t believe those grandsons can’t be killed by freezing

23
00:00:54,260 --> 00:00:55,620
I hope so

24
00:00:58,770 --> 00:01:03,880
Lin Hao, it’s me Qingshui

25
00:01:05,510 --> 00:01:07,150
The inspection is over, there's no big problem

26
00:01:07,590 --> 00:01:09,110
Let's find a clean place to talk

27
00:01:09,350 --> 00:01:10,790
Mr. Zhou Ms. Fang

28
00:01:11,270 --> 00:01:12,790
Lin Hao should tell you about the situation.

29
00:01:13,310 --> 00:01:16,190
We were passing through an area escaping from a university town.

30
00:01:16,270 --> 00:01:18,590
I originally thought that the villa was vacant and wanted to temporarily close it down.

31
00:01:19,640 --> 00:01:21,040
Everyone knows the situation outside

32
00:01:21,240 --> 00:01:22,720
It's remote here and safe for the time being.

33
00:01:22,720 --> 00:01:24,120
But no one knows how long it will be safe
